:: Jackson Hang Out End Early Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */

You turn to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> and tell him that you’d better head home. <span style="color:LightCoral">Instantly, the boy’s expression and body language deflates.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Already!?”</span> He cries out, grabbing you by the arm, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“but we haven’t even done anything yet! And it’s not even bedtime yet either! Can’t we stay a little longer, play a few more games? Pretty please!?”</span> The boy pleads with you, but you inform him that it is time for you to go. You can hang out more next time. <br>

