:: Jackson Hang Out End Early High Fun [nobr]

You turn to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> and tell him that you’d better head home. Instantly, the boy’s expression falls and he grabs you by the wrist. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Already!? But- but-! We’re having so much fun and it’s not even bedtime yet! Can’t we hang out a little more? Pretty please? With a cheery on top!?”</span> You sigh as the boy pleads with you, apologizing, but saying you really have to go. It was fun hanging out with him, and you’d love to do it again sometime, but it must end for today. <br>

