<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fine.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> sighs loudly, hanging his head low. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But we gotta hang out again soon! Like tomorrow! It was so much fun, and I have so much more games I want to play with you!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He gives you a smile, having had a great time hanging out despite its, in his opinion, early ending. You both wave goodbye as you walk off, happy for having hung out.</span> <br>
